    mir_let_annotated_result_overwritten_by_join_metadata_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 OPEN. val r: Result<i64, text> = if/match ... Ok(x_u8) gets MIR local HIR type Result<u8, text>: let_declared_type_override_v1 (mir_lowering_stmts.spl:1799-1808) returns 0 for a Result initializer so copy_local_hir_type_metadata writes the untyped-join type over the annotation; r.unwrap() then lowers as U8 via enum_match_expr_type -> result_ok_hir_type -> lower_result_unwrap_core. No wrong value seen yet (values fit 8 bits; narrow-unsigned arithmetic widens to i64). Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/mir_let_annotated_result_overwritten_by_join_metadata_2026-11-12.md."

